c(60, "§6.5", "data-caveat", "The single-review storefronts are where the anger is: 18 of 28 storefronts contributed exactly one review, averaging 3.33★ vs 4.31★, and five of six 1★ come from them (dk, pk, pt, pl, ca) — hypothesis: where almost nobody writes a review, the one who does is disproportionately the annoyed one; the long tail is negatively biased and the corpus-wide 1★ share (8.45%) overstates the global rate (public 4.58★).", "n/a", "mixed", "18 single-review stores at 3.33★; 5 of 6 1★", "none", "limited evidence", "generalisable", ["13064284382", "13200826254", "13277885578", "13307114320", "13349206242"], "", "")

